{"id":1748605,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-14T12:04:10.713Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1748605,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Asalkan Dia Bahagia","overview":"# Synopsis Translation  The story follows Adira, who becomes the object of desire of her own adoptive brother. Adira has always known that she is the adopted child of Madam Zarina and Mister Bakhtiar. Adira's relationship with their son, Ikmal Reza, is also very close. Upon reaching adulthood, Ikmal moves abroad after completing his studies and works there. Ikmal feels uncomfortable when he returns home because Adira is not his mahram, but there is something Ikmal is trying to hide. Not wanting Ikmal to continue living abroad because of Adira, Madam Zarina plans to arrange Adira's marriage. Adira, overhearing her adoptive mother's conversation, feels somewhat hurt and wants to gently push her away. Madam Zarina has given Adira too much kindness. Because of her love for her adoptive mother, she agrees to be matched with Haris Aryan, the son of a close family friend, Datin Maria and Dato Hijaz. Haris is also Ikmal's close friend.","popularity":0.0286,"poster_path":"/9J9ydMe3sg42aOiKMrTWD050d3t.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":124033,"logo_path":null,"name":"Zamriez Golden Picture Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Asalkan Dia Bahagia","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1740996,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Ayda Jebat","original_name":"Ayda Jebat","popularity":0.6424,"profile_path":"/wwAIPgE91U3KXJihj01IG87Qxmw.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7dafca4354c874d55f82f9","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id